isher.\n- **SEPARATELY-AUTHORIZED, NOT run (all gated/default-off):** H2 SA-1 metered shadow batch + SA-2 live evidence-engine flip; the live H1 payload re-stamp against `kb/aurora.db`.\n- **Commits:** 0eca5f2 (W1) Â· ffae677 (W2) Â· 2618f59 (W3) Â· 0a24914 (W4) Â· f046810 (W5) Â· e604fa4 (W6) Â· 7b23c9e (W7) Â· +W8 â€” **not pushed; awaiting John's review.**\n\nA recurring honest pattern threads the whole session: the build delivered **correct, gated, tested plumbing**, but measured three of the six llm.py \"wins\" (L2/L5/L6) as inert at Aurora's current scale â€” exactly the research's \"validate before banking\" caveat, now empirically confirmed rather than assumed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":784,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6976,"cache_read_input_tokens":34378,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6976},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"665e49e0-a0d8-40ef-9440-735929ba0a33","uuid":"2327de74-25c4-48c8-942e-bfefd412155c","request_id":"req_011CcKGw9cCi12w4TExhy2f6"}
